href=\"?note=da0bcf2e3f060472\" title=\"58-df-recursive\">58-df-recursive</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCompTotalRecursiveFunction}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCompTotalRecursiveFunction}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comp\\text{-}total\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}function}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcCompTotalRecursiveFunction}_S(f,k)\\leftrightarrow k\\in\\omega\\land f\\in\\mathrm{Rec}\\cap\\omega^{\\omega^k}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comp\\text{-}total\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}function}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcCompTotalRecursiveFunction}_S(f,k)\\leftrightarrow k\\in\\omega\\land f\\in\\mathrm{Rec}\\cap\\omega^{\\omega^k}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The arity is explicit, so the predicate covers the nullary, unary, and higher-arity total recursive functions contained in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rec}\">\\(\\mathrm{Rec}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"da0bcf2e3f060472","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-recursive]]","embed":fa